<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>SFINCS Pipeline Launcher</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f6f7fb;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --text: #172033;
      --muted: #667085;
      --line: #d9dee8;
      --accent: #315f9f;
      --accent-2: #173f73;
      --radius: 18px;
      --shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(24, 39, 75, 0.08);
      --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", monospace;
      --sans: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--sans);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #102a4f, #315f9f);
      color: white;
      padding: 30px clamp(18px, 4vw, 54px);
    }

    .header-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 { margin: 0; line-height: 1.15; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); letter-spacing: -0.04em; }

    .subtitle {
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      max-width: 820px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.86);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .status-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .status-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
      padding: 8px 0;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    .status-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .status-row span:first-child { color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7); }
    .status-row span:last-child { text-align: right; font-family: var(--mono); }

    main {
      max-width: 1400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 30px clamp(18px, 4vw, 54px) 54px;
    }

    .home-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: -58px;
    }

    .home-button {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      background: var(--panel);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 24px;
      min-height: 230px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 160ms ease, border-color 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
      text-align: left;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--text);
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .home-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(49, 95, 159, 0.18);
    }

    .mode-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      width: fit-content;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-2);
      background: #e7eef8;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .home-button strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .home-button p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.96rem; }
    .home-button .footer-note { margin-top: 18px; font-size: 0.86rem; }

    .help-button {
      position: fixed;
      left: 18px;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
      color: var(--accent-2);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      text-decoration: none;
      z-index: 50;
    }

    .help-button:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1100px) {
      .header-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .home-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin-top: 18px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .home-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      header { padding-bottom: 22px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>SFINCS Pipeline Launcher</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">Cluster-local launcher for building JSON configs, checking them with the existing backend runner, and preparing SFINCS jobs without editing stage scripts directly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-box" aria-label="Backend status summary">
        <div class="status-row"><span>Backend root</span><span>/proj/.../Flooding/pipeline</span></div>
        <div class="status-row"><span>Runner</span><span>code/pipeline_runner.py</span></div>
        <div class="status-row"><span>Session</span><span>Longleaf desktop</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="home-grid" aria-label="Main launcher options">
      <a class="home-button" href="manual.html">
        <div>
          <span class="mode-label">Manual</span>
          <strong>Manual Mode</strong>
          <p>Direct control over SFINCS inputs, paths, forcing options, runtime settings, and backend run configuration.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-note">Work in progress.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="home-button" href="override.html">
        <div>
          <span class="mode-label">Override</span>
          <strong>Override Mode</strong>
          <p>Skip setup steps by using already processed SFINCS input files and routing them into a new run configuration.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-note">V1 working.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="home-button" href="batch.html">
        <div>
          <span class="mode-label">Batch</span>
          <strong>Batch Generation</strong>
          <p>Generate many saved JSON configs from events or parameter sweeps before preflighting and submitting them.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-note">Coming Soon.</p>
      </a>

      <a class="home-button" href="guided.html">
        <div>
          <span class="mode-label">Guided</span>
          <strong>Guided Wizard</strong>
          <p>A guided workflow for new users that walks through the required choices one step at a time.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="footer-note">Coming Soon.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="home-button" href="/compare">

        <div>

          <span class="mode-label">Compare</span>

          <strong>Compare Runs</strong>

          <p>Compare completed SFINCS runs using quick, standard, or full Slurm-backed comparison jobs.</p>

        </div>

        <p class="footer-note">V1 working.</p>

      </a>


</section>
  </main>

  <a class="help-button" href="guide.html" title="Open launcher guide">?</a>
</body>
</html>